Subject: [PATCH] 436.9 ed7 run commit C: sealed constants and edition 7 run
 steps (spec v7 rev 6, 5.1)

- (i) extend_start_bound.JP3_SPEC_EDITION_V7 = "10902ffd" (sealed jp3_remedy_spec_v7.md
  revision 6, sha256 10902ffd..., master e241638d) with its docstring (lines 197-201 only).
- (ii) run_v5.ED7_KEY_FILE_SHA256 = the 5.1 table: sens_keys_ed7.json be930b75...,
  confirm_g1_grid171.json 684054ab... (ed7_design/keys_seal_b46bdf8f).
- (iii) 05_tests/unit/test_ed7_run_commit.py asserts both values (and the ed7_keys refusal /
  acceptance paths).
- (iv) prelaunch_j9/run_steps_ed7/: run-only steps of spec 4 steps 5-10 (scope evidence, L1
  references, T8 44, cases 10, probe a2 114, confirmation G1 171 + D 24, j9_main 388, sensitivity
  460, T-JR-12a VBM/VBM0, 12b plan --edition 7, VBKM0 / VBKM with T's P-pred decision file), new
  output path per step (existing attempt folder or output refused, M-7), start/end identity
  (HEAD, is_clean, 03_src tree), P7-10 scope asserted at every step start, no judge (T, 5.2),
  config template, dry run, P7-4 suite runner; Get-CoreKind records P / E / mixed
  (core_kind_ed7.ps1; edition 6 files unchanged).

